<#ff6420>WILHELMINA (ASSIST)</>
Wilhelmina		^X
  Calls Wilhelmina when her gauge (the bar with her portrait
  at the bottom of the screen) is full. Cancels from normals
  on contact.

<#ff6420>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
Guard Counter (1 bar, while blocking)		_F^A_+^B
Dash / Back Step		_F_F / _B_B
Air Dash		_F_F (air)

<#ff6420>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C

<#ff6420>SPECIALS</>
  A = light, B = medium. C = EX (half a bar); without half
  a bar C gives the heavy version.
Blazing Flame (ground/air)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Red Lotus (ground/air)		_F_D_DF^A / ^B
Sword Fire		_D_DB_B^A / ^B

<#ff6420>EX (half a bar)</>
Blaze Wing (ground/air)		_D_DF_F^C
Crimson Rose (ground/air)		_F_D_DF^C
Scaldic Sword		_D_DB_B^C

<#ff6420>SUPERS</>
Blazing Heart (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
  Any two of A / B / C.
Infernal Blade (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
  Any two of A / B / C.
Blazing Heart MAX (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
  Full-power Blazing Heart.
